@startuml
title cFS Subset Architecture (s000068_a8b7a94e)

actor "Developer/Build User" as Dev
actor "Functional Tester" as Tester
actor "Telemetry Operator" as Op

package "Build & Install" as Build {
  component "Makefile.sample\nsample_defs" as MakeAssets
  component "make prep\nmake install" as MakeSteps
  artifact "Build Artifacts\n(debug | release)" as Artifacts
}

package "Runtime Target" as Target {
  [core-cpu1] as CoreCPU1
  component cFE
  component OSAL
  component PSP
}

package "Host Utilities" as Host {
  [cmdUtil] as CmdUtil
  component "Telemetry Sink\n(Operator-configured IP)" as TelemetrySink
}

node "GitHub Actions (CI)" as GHA {
  component "Changelog Workflow\n(ubuntu-latest)" as Changelog
  component "Duplicate Check Workflow\n(ubuntu-latest)" as DupCheck
  component "Format Check Workflow\n(ubuntu-18.04)" as FormatCheck
  component "Functional Test Workflow\n(ubuntu-18.04, 15m timeout)" as FuncTest
  component "Reusable Workflows\n(workflow_call)" as ReusableWF
  artifact "Changelog Artifact" as ChangelogArtifact
}

Dev --> MakeSteps : build
MakeAssets --> MakeSteps : assets
MakeSteps --> Artifacts : produce
Artifacts --> CoreCPU1 : deploy/run

Tester --> CoreCPU1 : functional tests

CmdUtil --> CoreCPU1 : commands\n(--pktid, --cmdcode,\n--endian, --uint32...)
CoreCPU1 --> TelemetrySink : telemetry\n(to configured IP)
Op --> TelemetrySink : enter IP\n(e.g., 127.0.0.1)

GHA --> Changelog
GHA --> DupCheck
GHA --> FormatCheck
GHA --> FuncTest
Changelog --> ChangelogArtifact
ReusableWF <.. Changelog : reuse
ReusableWF <.. FormatCheck : reuse
ReusableWF <.. FuncTest : reuse

CoreCPU1 ..> cFE : uses
CoreCPU1 ..> OSAL : uses
CoreCPU1 ..> PSP : uses

note right of MakeSteps
  Uses provided make assets.
  Source checkout includes submodules.
end note

note bottom of CoreCPU1
  Accepts host commands from cmdUtil.
  Produces telemetry to operator-configured IP.
end note

note right of Changelog
  Organizes sections:
  Closed issues, Breaking changes,
  Enhancements, Bugs, Deprecated,
  Removed, Security fixes.
end note

note right of FormatCheck
  Runs on: push, pull_request, workflow_call.
end note

note over GHA
  Some reviewed workflows marked deprecated;
  revalidate applicability.
end note
@enduml
